# Git commits (Salah / salahalsuheme)

When creating git commits for this repository:

- Use author identity: **Salah Alsuheme** with email **salah.alsuheme@hotmail.com**.
- **Never** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor agent attribution to commit messages.
- Do **not** run `git commit` with `--author` pointing at other accounts unless the user explicitly requests another identity.
- Prefer plain commit messages with no co-author trailers.